{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","prNumber":577,"prUrl":"https://github.com/faucet-hq/faucet-stream/pull/577","prRepository":"faucet-hq/faucet-stream","timestamp":"2026-08-24T05:22:10.576Z"}
{"parentUuid":"77a2a705-995a-454c-9ff1-9e0fc4cfffb4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CeM1iKdnuwtyh3MSbGXc9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. All five features are on **PR #577** with auto-merge armed — it will land the instant the required checks go green (CI ~25 min).\n\n## What shipped in PR #577 (faucet-hq/faucet-stream)\n\n| # | Feature | Issue |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | **BigQuery auto-create** table + dataset on first sync (missing **and** schemaless), across append/upsert/exactly-once/overwrite | #578 |\n| 2 | **graphql offset-into-query-string** for ShopifyQL | #569 |\n| 3 | **`${map:}` computed-param interpolation** (derive one param from another) | #573 |\n| 4 | **`set` a column from `${parent.*}` / `${now.*}`** | #568 |\n| 5 | **flow-captured value into a raw XML/text body** (unblocks sage) | #567 |\n\nEach is its own commit with unit + integration tests; `schemas/faucet.schema.json` synced; docs updated. The PR body closes #567/#568/#569/#573/#578.\n\n## Local gates — all green\nfmt ✅ · workspace clippy `--all-features` ✅ (fixed 2 missing-field + collapsible-if + redundant-guard lints that only surfaced under `--all-targets --all-features`) · `cargo-semver-checks` faucet-core ✅ *\"no semver update required\"* (the `RequestAuth.captured` addition is non-breaking) · slim CLI build ✅ · `cargo doc -D warnings` ✅.\n\n## Also filed\n- **#578** — BigQuery auto-create (linked to this PR).\n- **#580** — the cross-sink auto-create follow-up you asked for (single tracking issue: `clickhouse`/`redshift` have no create-table at all; `mssql`/`postgres`/`mysql`/`sqlite`/`snowflake`/`spanner`/`duckdb`/`delta`/`iceberg` need consistency review; mongodb/ES auto-create implicitly). To tackle later.\n\n## Notes\n- The sandbox's `git push` fought me hard (credential-helper dialog + transfer stalls + background-job culling). Fixed by feeding the gh token inline; the branch had \"diverged\" because an earlier wrapper-push landed server-side despite reporting failure, so the final push was a clean `--force-with-lease`. Recorded the workaround in memory.\n- No automatic signal fires when auto-merge lands — I'll confirm the merged state on our next exchange (or you can check `gh pr checks 577`). Once merged, release-plz will open a release PR bumping the affected crates."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":534,"cache_read_input_tokens":736136,"output_tokens":876,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":534,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":876,"cache_read_input_tokens":736136,"cache_creation_input_tokens":534,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":534},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeM1iH6121pGuNJ2JwoH6","type":"assistant","uuid":"5f2fa6eb-e511-47b3-ae48-8af58c96bdeb","timestamp":"2026-08-24T05:22:26.205Z","effort":"high","session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","version":"2.1.228","gitBranch":"feat/bigquery-auto-create-table","slug":"linear-noodling-leaf"}
