{"parentUuid":"4e8d2286-8f77-4274-bd8c-894dfa4e1494","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CeM2oQieECZjcoe7ZX8TP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The watcher is running — it'll re-invoke me when #577 leaves the open state (merged). To avoid culling it, I won't run other commands while it waits.\n\n**Plan once #577 merges:** I'll implement **#580** — a consistent `create_table` (schema-inferred, default `true`) across every table-based sink, off fresh `main`:\n- **New capability** for `clickhouse` and `redshift` (no create-table today).\n- **Align to the contract**: `mssql` (currently `json_column`-only, default `false`), and verify/align `postgres`/`mysql`/`sqlite`/`snowflake`/`spanner`/`duckdb`/`delta`/`iceberg`.\n- A shared schema-inference→dialect-type helper in `faucet-core` (mirroring the BigQuery pattern from #577), per-sink `CREATE TABLE` generators, `registry.rs` allowlists, README + connector-matrix docs, `schemas/faucet.schema.json`, and unit + integration tests — driven to a green, auto-merged PR.\n\nIf the sandbox culls the watcher (it's been flaky with background jobs), just ping me and I'll pick up #580 immediately. I'll report back when #577 is merged and I start the work."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5210,"cache_read_input_tokens":739176,"output_tokens":413,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5210,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":413,"cache_read_input_tokens":739176,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5210,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5210},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeM2oN