{"parentUuid":"c177a9bb-8844-4706-bf8b-b0014c896b32","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14960416 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"cf0f86e7-d5f2-43cd-a626-3e071a735e46","timestamp":"2026-08-24T06:11:25.112Z","session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","version":"2.1.228","gitBranch":"feat/bigquery-auto-create-table","slug":"linear-noodling-leaf"}
{"parentUuid":"cf0f86e7-d5f2-43cd-a626-3e071a735e46","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CeM5U8Fkyf6gWu92sTMq3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Fixed and pushed. Here's what happened and where things stand.\n\n## Root cause of the CI failure\nBoth failing checks traced to **one mistake**: my clippy fixes were made locally but **never committed** before the push.\n\n- After the first full-workspace clippy flagged issues in `faucet-cli` (`missing field computed` in two `ParamSpec` test literals + `collapsible_if` + `redundant_guards`), I edited the fixes and re-ran clippy **`-p faucet-cli` only** (green) — then went straight to the schema splice without committing those two files.\n- So the pushed commit `b90cbdf9` lacked the fixes → **Clippy** failed (exit 101) and **Test** failed too (the cli lib test couldn't compile without `ParamSpec.computed`). The \"flaky Docker\" retries were a red herring — it was a compile failure.\n\n## Fix\n- Committed the fixes (`fix(cli): commit clippy fixes …`).\n- The branch had meanwhile been updated from `main` (a clean \"merge main\" with 6 newer commits), so I **fetched + rebased my fix commit onto the remote HEAD** (`git rebase --onto`) rather than force-dropping main's commits — keeping the branch current.\n- Verified the rebased tree builds and my #573 computed-param filter survived the merge, then pushed `66a2e551`.\n- **Auto-merge is still armed.**\n\nI also re-ran the **full** `--workspace --all-targets --all-features` clippy locally on the intended state — clean (exit 0) — and recorded the lesson in memory (re-run the *broad* gate after a fix, and confirm `git status` is clean of the fix before pushing).\n\n## Now\nCI is re-running on `66a2e551` with all five features + the fixes. Auto-merge will land it once green. Once #577 merges, I'll start **#580** (consistent auto-create-table across the remaining table sinks) as we agreed. I'll confirm the merge on the next exchange (or ping me if you see it go green first)."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1211,"cache_read_input_tokens":783411,"output_tokens":675,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1211,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":675,"cache_read_input_tokens":783411,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1211,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1211},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeM5U61aLqZrvKBvJzGZE","type":"assistant","uuid":"0f97124b-b49b-4fc4-960b-d996db80eb78","timestamp":"2026-08-24T06:11:37.569Z","effort":"high","session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","version":"2.1.228","gitBranch":"feat/bigquery-auto-create-table","slug":"linear-noodling-leaf"}
