{"parentUuid":"e5df9790-97c3-459c-a941-32af3012424e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CeM7AQbzpMpBZVRFpVtHj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Everything's clean and pushed; I'll stay quiet now so the watcher survives.\n\n**Status:**\n- `5f837e65` pushed with the fmt fix; **local final gate on the committed tree is green** (`fmt --check` exit 0, `--workspace --all-targets --all-features` clippy exit 0).\n- Auto-merge **armed**; CI re-running.\n- Fresh watcher will resume me when #577 merges (or report a failure).\n\n**On the repeated CI misses** — both were the same root cause: I verified in pieces (`fmt` before edits, clippy on a single crate, committing without a final re-check) rather than running the whole gate on the exact commit being pushed. Corrected process, now applied: `git status` clean of intended edits → `fmt --check` + full `--all-features` clippy on the committed state → push. That's what I just did for `5f837e65`.\n\nOnce #577 merges I'll start **#580**. I'll report back when the watcher fires."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1606,"cache_read_input_tokens":795776,"output_tokens":320,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1606,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":320,"cache_read_input_tokens":795776,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1606,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1606},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeM7ALxiqZzxS8BQz3HXV","type":"assistant","uuid":"c03cb41b-a27f-4890-abb3-b62861d7d3c8","timestamp":"2026-08-24T06:33:50.324Z","effort":"high","session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-88