{"parentUuid":"068a5862-ca82-44bd-9b4d-e4637e55adea","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CeMJR4HKTqS7aMnen9GK1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The full gate (fmt + workspace clippy) is running on the tree I'll commit. I'll wait for it, then commit the coverage tests and push — this time verifying the complete gate on the exact committed state before pushing (the discipline I should have held all along).\n\n**Recap for you:** CI's only red was the **90% patch-coverage floor** (89.12%) — all tests pass. I've added targeted tests to close the gap and push toward 95%:\n- `bind.rs` — 6 tests for the computed-param/`${map:}` error branches (unterminated, disallowed directive, bad case, missing switch, unknown input, whole-token map)\n- `rest` — a captured-provider test (URL/header `${session_id}` substitution)\n- `bigquery` — non-404 schema-probe error + uninferable-schema error\n- `core auth` — `with_captured` / captured-`is_empty`\n- `expand` — reserved built-in tokens in a transform config\n\nThat's ~35–38 newly-covered changed lines (89.12% → ~94%), comfortably clearing the 90% gate and approaching your 95% target. I'll report the gate result and the pushed commit next."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1032,"cache_read_input_tokens":861060,"output_tokens":381,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1032,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":381,"cache_read_input_tokens":861060,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1032,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1032},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeMJQz73eLUVuD1YPaaZF",