{"parentUuid":"855f1cb6-f3ca-480b-a53f-9a33622be9c2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CeML2Jc8L6Q5DdDBqZLBG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The zip is ready: **`~/Desktop/faucet-stream-baf97200.zip`** (7.7 MB, 2054 files, extracts into a `faucet-stream/` folder).\n\n**What's in it:** the full tracked source at `main` (`baf97200`) — all 92 crates (`crates/`, `cli/`, `faucet-stream/`), `docs/`, `examples/`, `benchmarks/`, `.github/`, `schemas/`, Cargo manifests + `Cargo.lock`, README/LICENSE/CONTRIBUTING, **and the `.claude/rules/*.md` dev-reference files** (they're git-tracked).\n\n**Deliberately excluded** (git-archive skips `.git` + everything gitignored):\n- `target/` (the multi-GB build dir) — that's why it's only 7.7 MB.\n- `.git/` history.\n- Local/private files: the root `CLAUDE.md`, any `.env`, and the internal `faucet-local-demo/drivetrain/` Meltano templates.\n\n**Safety-checked** — no secrets leaked. (The `cli/src/secrets/*.rs` the scan flagged are the *secrets-manager connector source* — legitimate public code, not credentials.)\n\nA couple of things worth knowing:\n- Since faucet-stream is a **public repo**, your collaborator could alternatively just `git clone https://github.com/faucet-hq/faucet-stream` — they'd get full history and always-latest. The zip is the right move if they don't have access or you want the exact `main` snapshot.\n- The zip has **no `CLAUDE.md`** (it's gitignored + has personal/internal bits like the `PawanSikawat`/`pawan-dt` gh-auth workflow). If you want the collaborator to have the dev guide, I can drop a **sanitized** CLAUDE.md into a copy of the zip (stripping the personal auth/account specifics) — just say so.\n\nWant me to also include a sanitized CLAUDE.md, or is the clean source zip what you need?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4787,"cache_read_input_tok