{"parentUuid":"0d8c4f06-f03c-4bf7-8f84-f29938487f00","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CeMMw1pBEGVERF1ePeaYU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4244,"cache_read_input_tokens":943229,"output_tokens":3081,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":2122},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4244,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3081,"cache_read_input_tokens":943229,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4244,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4244},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeMMvwe9mZ9sRLx8GyoFn","type":"assistant","uuid":"cc14d481-410e-4bc3-99fb-7faf0b00bb3f","timestamp":"2026-08-24T09:47:54.164Z","effort":"high","session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","version":"2.1.231","gitBranch":"feat/sinks-auto-create-table","slug":"linear-noodling-leaf"}
{"parentUuid":"cc14d481-410e-4bc3-99fb-7faf0b00bb3f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CeMMw1pBEGVERF1ePeaYU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both answered:\n\n## faucet-lineage at 2.0 — totally fine ✅\n\nThe rule isn't \"everything becomes `\"1\"`\" — it's **caret-major = each crate's *current* major**. So:\n- `faucet-lineage` (2.1.0) → `version = \"2\"` (its dependents are just the umbrella `faucet-stream` + `cli`)\n- everything else (all major 1) → `\"1\"`\n- `faucet-conformance` stays as-is (it's path-only with no version — a dev/test crate, already decoupled)\n\nI checked all ~90 internal crates: **only `faucet-lineage` is major 2; every other is major 1.** Mixed majors are completely normal here. And a crate at 2.x doesn't change the benefit: a `faucet-lineage` 2.1 → 2.2 *minor* bump satisfies `\"2\"`, so no cascade. The *only* time a bump still cascades is a **major** bump (e.g. lineage → 3.0 forces cli/umbrella from `\"2\"` → `\"3\"`) — and that's *correct*: a breaking change is exactly when dependents should re-release and acknowledge it. We're only killing the noise from minor/patch bumps.\n\n## Risks — low, and contained\n\n1. **Wrong major on a req** → build breaks. Mitigated: I derive each req from the crate's actual current major (the list above), so lineage=`\"2\"`, rest=`\"1\"`.\n2. **`-Z minimal-versions` edge case** — a downstream forcing minimal versions could resolve an older `faucet-core` than a sink actually needs. Default cargo (newest-compatible) never hits this, and umbrella/CLI users get a consistent set anyway. Theoretical, not practical.\n3. **release-plz might still tighten a satisfied req** — the one thing I can't be 100% sure of from docs alone. That's why I'd **dry-run** it before trusting (below).\n4. **Reversibility** — it's one file (`Cargo.toml` `[workspace.dependencies]`); trivially revertable if a dry-run shows it doesn't behave.\n\nNo risk touches runtime behavior or the published *code* — only the version *requirement* metadata. The `faucet-core` cargo-semver-checks gate is what guarantees `\"1\"` is sound.\n\n## Plan\nI'll do it as a small isolated PR: set each internal `faucet-*` workspace dep to its caret-major (`faucet-lineage = \"2\"`, the rest `\"1\"`, `faucet-conformance` untouched), then **dry-run release-plz** to confirm a hypothetical `faucet-core` bump no longer cascades into the sinks before we rely on it. If the dry-run still cascades, I revert and we reconsider — no harm done.\n\nWant me to go ahead and open that PR? (It won't affect the pending release PR — it just changes how *future* bumps propagate.)"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4244,"cache_read_input_tokens":943229,"output_tokens":3081,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":2122},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4244,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3081,"cache_read_input_tokens":943229,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4244,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4244},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeMMvwe9mZ9sRLx8GyoFn","type":"assistant","uuid":"64a9f7c3-e1e6-4d23-aab0-0b06d2b69e9d","timestamp":"2026-08-24T09:48:06.962Z","effort":"high","session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","version":"2.1.231","gitBranch":"feat/sinks-auto-create-table","slug":"linear-noodling-leaf"}
